libsdl2-2.0-0
=============

This package provides the "classic" implementation of SDL 2 on the
normal search path. The intention is for sdl2-compat, a reimplementation
of SDL 2 as a wrapper around SDL 3, to take over as the default SDL 2
implementation during the Debian 14 'forky' release cycle.

To get a preview of the future situation, install libsdl2-compat-shim,
libsdl2-classic and (if wanted) libsdl2-compat-dev, removing libsdl2-2.0-0
and libsdl2-dev.

Please see the README.Debian of the libsdl2-compat package for details
of how to test sdl2-compat:

<https://salsa.debian.org/sdl-team/sdl2-compat/-/blob/HEAD/debian/README.Debian>
<file:///usr/share/doc/libsdl2-compat/README.Debian>
